{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50703","headline":"寓居临平山下三首 其三 · 张祜","name":"寓居临平山下三首 其三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"散髪垂肩久不簪，竹床推椀就藤阴。\n涧傍春渡水流急，山半夜归云色深。\n拂槛数竿爲去处，随波一叶是浮沉。\n世间年少正行乐，应笑老人无事心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}